WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.940 --> 00:00:04.520
Dogs are welcome at most beaches in the
Waimakariri

00:00:04.520 --> 00:00:06.760
but you need to take care around horses.

00:00:06.760 --> 00:00:09.860
If your dog cannot be effectively controlled with your voice

00:00:09.860 --> 00:00:12.160
then it must be put on its leash.

